  "final_text": "Here are five distinct **in-stock** kits from the live catalog, selected for their concrete prices and useful retailer descriptions. Prices are in Danish kroner.\n\n| Product | Listed price | Who would enjoy it | Practical reason for the choice |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| [Officiel Raspberry Pi 500+ Desktop Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/raspberry-pi-500-plus-kit/) | **2.499,00 kr.** DKK *(sale; regular price 3.499,00 kr.)* | A hobbyist or newcomer wanting to set up a Raspberry Pi 500+ as a desktop computer | The retailer says it contains the essentials needed to get started with the new computer, reducing the need to source basic accessories separately. |\n| [Waveshare CM5 PoE Mini-Computer Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/waveshare-cm5-poe-mini-computer-kit/) | **399,00 kr.** DKK | An experienced maker interested in Compute Module 5, embedded systems, or product prototyping | Described as suitable both for **evaluating Raspberry Pi CM5** and for integration into finished products; Power over Ethernet also makes it relevant to PoE projects. |\n| [Compute Blade Starter Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/compute-blade-starter-kit/) | **2.999,00 kr.** DKK *(sale; regular price 3.480,00 kr.)* | A homelab or distributed-computing enthusiast | The kit is specifically intended for starting a **small Compute Blade cluster**, with four Compute Blades and other practical accessories included. |\n| [Officiel Raspberry Pi 500 Desktop Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/officiel-raspberry-pi-500-kit/) | **1.649,00 kr.** DKK | Someone who wants a straightforward Raspberry Pi 500 desktop starting point | Like the 500+ kit, the retailer describes it as containing the important items needed to begin using the new computer. |\n| [Officiel Raspberry Pi 5 Desktop Kit](https://raspberrypi.dk/produkt/raspberry-pi-5-desktop-kit/) | **1.399,00–3.699,00 kr.** DKK *(option-dependent)* | A Raspberry Pi 5 enthusiast who wants to tailor the computer’s configuration | The retailer says it includes everything needed to get started, with **RAM and language options**; an English book is included with all kits. |",
